<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Hover Card</title>
<style>
.card{
width:280px;
height:180px;
background:white;
border-radius:12px;
padding:20px;
box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
transition:transform 0.3s ease,box-shadow 0.3s ease;
}
.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
box-shadow:0 12px 25px rgba(0,128,128,0.4);
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<h2>Hover Me</h2>
<p>This card lifts up and shows a coloured shadow.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
